                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb126ebc-d808-486a-9125-4a332854d702",
                                "sense_id": "2f4bd57f-67e5-3a7d-afb7-8d486919ea45",
                                "text": "Ле́том люби́л он уходи́ть в окре́стности, забира́лся в ста́рые монастыри́ и вгля́дывался в тё́мные углы́, в почерне́лые ли́ки святы́х и му́чеников, и фанта́зия, лу́чше профессоро́в, уноси́ла его́ в ру́сскую старину́.",
                                "translation": "In the summer, he liked to take walks in the surrounding area, find his way into old monasteries, and peer into their dark corners, and see the blackened visages of saints and martyrs, and his imagination – more effective than all his professors’ – took him back to the Russia of yore<...>",
                                "english": "In the summer, he liked to take walks in the surrounding area, find his way into old monasteries, and peer into their dark corners, and see the blackened visages of saints and martyrs, and his imagination – more effective than all his professors’ – took him back to the Russia of yore<...>"
